summary: ipxe iso boot test
description: |
    ipxe test booting ipxe.iso from the ipxe-bootimgs package into a vm.
    It just checks that the VM boots a RHEL kernel going through an ipxe
    script.
contact: Jiri Dluhos <jdluhos@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
path: /ipxe/iso
framework: beakerlib
require:
  - expect
  - httpd
  - ipxe-bootimgs
  - libvirt
  - qemu-kvm
  - virt-install
adjust+:
  - enabled: false
    when: arch != x86_64
duration: 1h
